# parkinglot — use the Droplet workspace

This repo is meant to be opened with **`parkinglot-droplet.code-workspace`** (Remote SSH → host **`parkinglot`**, path **`/opt/workspaces/parkinglot`**).

If the user sees **`main · local`** in the status bar, they are on the **Mac clone**, not the Droplet. Tell them to run **`./scripts/open-cursor-droplet.sh`** or double-click **`Open Parkinglot on Droplet.command`**. See **`docs/OPEN-PARKINGLOT-IN-CURSOR.md`**.

Deploy/sync: **`make droplet-sync`** only from the droplet workspace or with **`deploy/droplet.target`** respected.
